[{'pub_no': '20090324148', 'appl_id': '12165303', 'claim_no': '10', 'claim_txt': '10. The rotary machine of claim 1, wherein the one or more parameters related to the foil bearing comprises temperature, strain, pressure, vibration, or combinations thereof.', 'dependencies': '1', 'ind_flg': '0'}, {'pub_no': '20090324148', 'appl_id': '12165303', 'claim_no': '11', 'claim_txt': '11. The rotary machine of claim 1; wherein the fiber optic sensing system comprises a detection system configured to receive reflected light from the one or more fiber optic sensors.', 'dependencies': '1', 'ind_flg': '0'}, {'pub_no': '20090324148', 'appl_id': '12165303', 'claim_no': '13', 'claim_txt': '13. The rotary machine of claim 12; wherein the rotary machine comprises an engine coupled to the controller; wherein the controller is configured to throttle the engine when the detected one or more parameters related to the foil bearing system exceeds a threshold limit.', 'dependencies': '12', 'ind_flg': '0'}, {'pub_no': '20090324148', 'appl_id': '12165303', 'claim_no': '16', 'claim_txt': '16. A foil bearing system, comprising: a bearing shell; a top foil disposed in the bearing shell; a bump foil disposed between the bearing shell and the top foil; and a fiber optic sensing system comprising one or more fiber optic sensors disposed in the bearing shell; on the top foil; or a combinations thereof and configured to detect one or more parameters related to the foil bearing system.', 'dependencies': None, 'ind_flg': '1'}, {'pub_no': '20090324148', 'appl_id': '12165303', 'claim_no': '17', 'claim_txt': '17. The system of claim 16; wherein the fiber optic sensors are disposed in a plurality of grooves provided in the bearing shell, and the top foil.', 'dependencies': '16', 'ind_flg': '0'}]

